// International Sales module (ported from Shalman's fork). Native ERP tables —
// preserve across regens.
//
// Porting notes (Phase 1):
//  - The fork attached hard relations to User (sp/manager/createdBy/checkedBy/
//    user). Our core User model is untouched: those are plain String id
//    columns here (commented "-> users.id"), resolved in app code.
//  - PRODUCTION_MANAGER (fork SalesRole) is intentionally NOT ported; those
//    checks map to ADMIN in Phase 2. users.sales_role / users.sales_factory
//    columns are also deferred to Phase 2.
